  "description": "A lightweight, event-driven watchdog timer for .NET. Ideal for debouncing, deferred callbacks, and auto-reset behaviors. Avoids TaskCanceledException by design, with optional completion and cancellation events, and observable Running state via INotifyPropertyChanged.",
  "id": "IVSoftware.Portable.WatchdogTimer",
  "isPrerelease": false,
